From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Treggat <taggert2222@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:34:40 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 13/27] sycl : fused q4_K dequant + f16 DPAS GEMM for short
 prefill ubatches

Runtime switch GGML_SYCL_DQ_GEMM (default off). q4_K x f32 MUL_MAT with
33..1536 columns runs a fused kernel that dequantizes weights into SLM and
feeds f16 joint_matrix with f32 accumulation, skipping the separate
full-matrix dequant pass; larger batches keep dequant + oneDNN with a
vectorised f32->f16 activation conversion. Tunables: _MIN_COLS (33),
_MAX_COLS, _FUSED_MAX_COLS (1536), _IMPL=ref, _PAD, _TILE, _FASTCVT, _Q6K.
GGML_SYCL_OP_PROFILE gains per-call averages and sub-phase rows. Adds
prefill eval/perf cases (MUL_MAT_PREFILL) to test-backend-ops.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
